R4blMO0usmhBg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>深圳大学医学部口腔医学专业硕士点于2024年9月获批，同年启动推免及统考招生工作。学位点依托深圳大学医学部和深圳大学口腔医学研究所，现拥有国家口腔规培基地5个，广东省高水平临床重点专科1个，国家口腔疾病临床医学研究中心（上海九院）深圳分中心、深圳市医学重点学科及深圳市医学重点培育学科各1个，以培养口腔医学应用型和创新型复合人才为目的和创新特色。口腔医学研究所在医学部的支持下搭建了多个科研平台，包括DNA/RNA检测平台、蛋白质检测平台、硬组织研究平台、组织影像及细胞培养平台。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>我院口腔医学学科在不断发展壮大的过程中, 形成口腔颌面外科学、口腔内科学、口腔修复学及口腔正畸学为特色的四个研究方向。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/2lNicNB6vUI1BLn5RWVbzfMiclIRhkkAhliciaa5Uq47F1fP1vpgD8YmU8EN2zIOKYPYfCWJve6ZZofAibibMp