\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2lNicNB6vUI1BLn5RWVbzfMiclIRhkkAhlfSibOuFpkcXPYjthlqR0m9eqzTtjzpL13PGlUbjCC6aBw6PquSqAIWg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2lNicNB6vUI1BLn5RWVbzfMiclIRhkkAhlp10FApwotZahkrNVnuSANvlbz1m7BaQsDJic95J5UpR4blMO0usmhBg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>活动时间</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2025年7月13日-15日</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>活动地点</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>深圳大学丽湖校区守贤楼（A1楼）</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>内容安排</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.开营仪式，学院介绍，使学员对本学科的科研平台、师资和实验室资源等有深入了解（7月14日9点）；</span></p><p><span>2.参观各方向实验室，并与研究生导师面对面交流，了解本学科主要研究内容及成果；</span></p><p><span>3.观摩学习虚拟机操作的教学，并实操训练；</span></p><p><span>4.观摩学习显微镜下缝合的教学，并实操训练；</span></p><p><span>5.结营仪式（7月15日11点）。</span></p><p><span>*活动安排可能因现场情况变动，以实际安排为准。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>招生对象</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>具有推免权高校（含本校深圳大学）的有意推免或报考我校硕士研究生的</span><strong><span>2026届优秀本科毕业生。</span></strong></p><p><span>招生规模：限招</span><strong><span>15人</span></strong><span>（按GPA、科研经历、英语水平综合筛选）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>报名时间</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>即日起至6月30日17:30</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>报名方式</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、系统报名</span></p><p><strong><span>https://ehall.szu.edu.cn/geapp/sys/sdyjszsxt/login/goLogin.do</span></strong></p><p><span>点击报名链接，填写个人信息，并上传申请材料。</span></p><p><span>2、申请材料</span></p></section></section><section><section><ul><li><p><span>个人简介</span></p></li><li><p><span>有效期内的身份证</span></p></li><li><p><span>学生证(每学期加盖有注册章)</span></p></li><li><p><span>自入学起至2025年6月的成绩单(含专业排名、GPA，且有学校教务部门或所在院系公章，如有不实，取消资格)</span></p></li><li><p><span>省级及以上学术竞赛获奖证明</span></p></li><li><p><span>大学英语四、六级考试成绩、或TOEFL成绩、或GRE/GMAT成绩等体现自身英语水平的证明</span></p></li><li><p><span>申请人还可提交体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果</span></p></li></ul><p><span>【注:仅需提交电子版本扫描件】</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>审核录取</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>入营录取通知:经由学员提交材料、专家严格初审，我院将于</span><strong><span>2025年7月5日</span></strong><span>前在深圳大学医学部口腔医学院网站</span><strong><span>（https://med.szu.edu.cn/kqyxxy/jyjx/yjsjy/yjstzgg)</span></strong><span>的“人才培养-研究生教育-通知公告”栏公布夏令营学员入选名单，未录取者，不另行通知，公示后如放弃请邮件告知(邮箱:dentistry@szu.edu.cn）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>注意事项</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.住宿与交通补助：</span><span><span>本届暑期学校不收取任何费用，学员需自行安排食宿，暑期学校会提供一定的补助（凭住宿和交通发票进行报销，广东省外学员报销额度上限为1000元，省内学员报销上限为500元）。</span></span></p><p><span>2.学生报到时，需出示身份证、学生证原件。全体营员须全程参加活动，无故缺席将取消申请资格（详细日程安排待公布入营名单时另行通知）。</span></p><p><span>3.申请人必须确保提供的信息和材料真实、准确，若发现有弄虚作假行为，一经查实，取消申请资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section>